{
  "_doc": [
    "Sprites: height is a fraction of screen height; frames animate at fps; spin = pre-rendered rotation steps;",
    "anim = folder of baked clips (tools/bake), directions = 4 rotated variants instead of a mirror;",
    "flap / flicker = fake wing beat / candle light from a single drawing (flicker_min: from that level on; 99 = off).",
    "Elements: min/max = level range where it appears: 1 = now and then one decoration … 7 = the day before,",
    "8 = the day itself (9 = demo grid of all sprites). count/max_active/every grow from min to 'full' (default 8).",
    "video_min = from which level it also shows over a playing video (default never).",
    "band = keep to the left/right screen edges (below 8). hz = redraw rate (default 15, particles 12).",
    "say = speech balloon (only when themes_text is on).",
    "Types: decor (always there), visitor (comes and goes: cast of sprite+anchor+places), particles, flyer, walker,",
    "dropper (spider on a thread), crawler (baked walker), performer (baked character scene), peeker,",
    "weaver (a spider building a web in a top corner), prowler (a black cat strolling along the bottom).",
    "group = exclusive category (on an element or a cast entry): one spider, one bat, one flyer... at a time.",
    "flyer: y = height in the middle of the screen, bend = how much lower towards the sides (an arc, the middle stays clear);",
    "a sprite with sizes = [0.8, 0.62] flies at a random depth (smaller = farther = slower).",
    "cast near_logo: true = hang from the top edge somewhere around/over the watermark logo.",
    "solid: true = the cat can climb onto it (pumpkins, tombstones, the coffin)."
  ],
